@startuml
[*] --> Unregistered :
Unregistered --> Registered : User creates an account
Registered --> Logged In : User logs in
Logged In --> Application Submitted : User applies for visa and payment is made
Application Submitted --> Application Status Viewed : User views application status
Application Status Viewed --> Completed Status Update : Document check is completed and visa is approved or rejected
Application Status Viewed --> Feedback Given : User gives feedback
Application Submitted --> Application Canceled : User cancels application
Logged In --> Details Modified : User modifies details
Logged In --> View Details : User views details
Application Status Viewed --> Details Modified : User modifies details
Application Status Viewed --> View Details : User views details
Details Modified --> Logged In :
View Details --> Logged In :
Feedback Given --> Completed Status Update :
Completed Status Update --> [*] : Final State

Logged In --> Logout : User logs out
Logout --> Unregistered :

@enduml
